The machine-translation engine (io.github.harrythecake.caketext.translator.mt)
is an independent Java implementation of the algorithms of the following
projects, checked against their output. No code from them is included.
- Hugging Face Transformers (MarianMTModel and its generation code)
  Copyright The HuggingFace Team. Apache License 2.0.
- SentencePiece (unigram tokenizer and normalization)
  Copyright Google Inc. Apache License 2.0.
- darts-clone (double-array trie used by SentencePiece's character map)
  Copyright Susumu Yata. BSD 2-Clause License.

The opus-mt-en-zh model (Helsinki-NLP, Apache License 2.0) is not included.
Players download it themselves from Hugging Face.
